  "open": {
    "F1": "finding, product (reset lifecycle of P4): one Redis restart with a purchase in flight costs two generations; R2 and R3 stay failing on it; not fixed, the maintainer decides",
    "F2": "limit, product (shutdown): after SIGTERM an instance that answered a request while shutting down stays up until that connection closes, 73.3 s with a keep-alive client",
    "O1": "the existing direct checkout without admission fields answers 500 when its serialization retries run out",
    "O2": "a reloaded page cannot reach an order whose checkout answer was lost",
    "O3": "the page shows an event that became protected after it loaded as unprotected until a reload",
    "O4": "a PostgreSQL pool error is logged with the driver's client object: connection parameters and the cancel key of the ended session, no password"
